From: openEuler RISC-V Maintainers <noreply@example.invalid>
Date: Sat, 12 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] tests: export XDG_DATA_HOME to the child

The fixture invokes the test binary as a child process. Export its XDG value so
the child can observe the environment being asserted.
---
 tests/test1 | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/tests/test1 b/tests/test1
index f8e9c6d..8ff0941 100755
--- a/tests/test1
+++ b/tests/test1
@@ -1,6 +1,6 @@
 #!/usr/bin/env sh
 
-XDG_DATA_HOME="/aaa"
+export XDG_DATA_HOME="/aaa"
 
 expected="$XDG_DATA_HOME"
 
-- 
2.51.0
